WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:10.313
ProfCalendar is the all-in-one teacher planner: your lessons, your classes, your
marks, your attendance and your documents, all in one place. Here is how it works.

2
00:00:10.764 --> 00:00:22.848
Everything starts on the dashboard. Quick actions take you anywhere in one click:
your next lesson, the calendar, class management and your files. Your tasks and
favourite links stay close at hand.

3
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:32.198
The calendar shows your week period by period, in your classes' colours. Your
canton's school holidays and public holidays are already in place.

4
00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:39.371
Click a period to open its plan: a title, the lesson flow with checkboxes, and the
documents you'll need.

5
00:00:39.923 --> 00:00:47.078
On the day, the lesson page brings everything together on one screen: your plan,
pinned documents and the class list.

6
00:00:47.629 --> 00:00:54.465
Taking attendance takes a single tap: present, absent or late. You can even dictate
a remark by voice.

7
00:00:55.015 --> 00:01:05.883
Your PDFs open in the built-in reader: pen, highlighter, ruler, compass and set
square in real centimetres. On iPad, the Apple Pencil writes with no lag.

8
00:01:06.436 --> 00:01:13.165
Class management brings together your students, their marks, absences, behaviour
tallies and the seating plan.

9
00:01:13.716 --> 00:01:21.384
Enter the points for each assessment: marks and averages calculate themselves, and
export to PDF or a spreadsheet.

10
00:01:21.938 --> 00:01:28.347
Build the seating plan by dragging students onto desks. During the lesson, you see
who sits where at a glance.

11
00:01:28.899 --> 00:01:35.372
The file manager keeps your documents from one year to the next, and copies them
into your classes in one move.

12
00:01:35.922 --> 00:01:41.947
To see for yourself, open the demo account on profcalendar.org: no sign-up needed.
